# OTA = full V2 with games

Whenever the user says **OTA** (deploy OTA, update OTA, push to OTA, redeploy web bundle, pages.dev, Capacitor remote UI), they mean the **full V2 app with games** — same as the store AAB/internal build.

## Required build

- `VITE_ARXON_UI_V2=true`
- `VITE_WORD_FORGE_ENABLED=true`
- `vite build --mode word-forge` / `npm run build:internal` (or `npm run build`, which must stay locked to word-forge)

Target: `https://arxon-mobile.pages.dev` (Capacitor OTA).

## Never

- Do **not** deploy classic mining-only OTA (`vite build` without word-forge / without those flags) unless the user **explicitly** asks for classic.

## After deploy

- Confirm `web-bundle-version.json` updated
- Confirm live JS includes `/games`, Dice/Word Forge (or `uiV2`/`wordForge` stamps)
- Remind: force-close and reopen the Play app
